@startuml
title Deployment Diagram - Runtime Topology
left to right direction

node "User Device" {
  artifact "Web Browser\nReact SPA (:3000 dev)" as Browser
}

node "Application Server" {
  artifact "Node.js + Express API\n:4000" as API
  artifact "Prisma Client\n(runtime ORM layer)" as PrismaClient
  folder "uploads/" as UploadFolder
}

node "Database Server" {
  database "PostgreSQL\nPrisma-managed schema" as PG
}

cloud "Email Provider SMTP/API" as Mail

Browser --> API : HTTPS/HTTP REST (/api/*)
API --> PrismaClient : query models
PrismaClient --> PG : SQL
API --> UploadFolder : file write/read
API --> Mail : send notification/reset email

@enduml
